{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12109080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12109080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1210908001:1":{"text":"휴... 결국 걸려들었군... 다들 괜찮아?","source_cn":"唉……果然中招了……大家都没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EB38EBEDFD74DF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1210908002:1":{"text":"하나, 둘, 셋, 넷, 다섯... 나까지 여섯. 다행이다... 다 있네.","source_cn":"一、二、三、四、五……算上我，六个。还好还好……都在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4362BA0C08FEB7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1210908002":{"text":"하나, 둘, 셋, 넷, 다섯... 나까지 여섯. 다행이다... 다 있네.","source_cn":"一、二、三、四、五……算上我，六个。还好还好……都在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4362BA0C08FEB7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210908003:1":{"text":"맞아.","source_cn":"没错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x21C71526BAA2F65D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아.","female":"맞아.","variant_male_record_index":"130702","variant_female_record_index":"130703","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210908005:1":{"text":"그 보물상자는 함정이었어. 보물상자를 함부로 연 사람은 위험한 지역으로 텔레포트 되는 거지.","source_cn":"那个宝箱是陷阱宝箱，会把擅自打开它的人传送到某些危险区域。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C44B8920DB8D7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210908006:1":{"text":"이런 함정은 보통 도적을 상대로 쓰여서 칼이 가득한 함정이나 굶주린 사자가 있는 우리 같은 곳으로 텔레포트 될 텐데...","source_cn":"这种陷阱一般用来对付盗贼，往往会把人传到什么布满了刀的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2908C686453369EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210908007:1":{"text":"... 우리는 운이 좋았어. 이곳은 기믹이 없는 거 같아.","source_cn":"……看来我们运气好，这附近不像有什么机关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BE8B0A35F0B48E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210908008:1":{"text":"미, 미안해, 언니. 내가... 너무 노는 데 정신이 팔려서 그만.","source_cn":"对、对不起，索尼娅姐姐，是我……太贪玩了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C2D46B1E2EB9AD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210908009:1":{"text":"나라의 잘못이 아니에요. 치피였어도 바로 보물상자를 열어봤을 거예요.","source_cn":"不怪奈拉啦，要是满满看到宝箱，也会第一时间打开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E6753810F006B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1210908009":{"text":"나라의 잘못이 아니에요. 치피였어도 바로 보물상자를 열어봤을 거예요.","source_cn":"不怪奈拉啦，要是满满看到宝箱，也会第一时间打开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E6753810F006B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210908010:1":{"text":"이름이... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>였던가?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE5A3344EB836A011","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이름이... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>였던가?","female":"이름이... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>였던가?","variant_male_record_index":"130711","variant_female_record_index":"130712","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210908011:1":{"text":"내 탓이 아니라고 위로까지 해주다니, 참 좋은 사람이네!","source_cn":"你不怪我，还安慰我！你真好！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6FC7CA1DFD3AFF52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내 탓이 아니라고 위로까지 해주다니, 참 좋은 사람이네!","female":"내 탓이 아니라고 위로까지 해주다니, 참 좋은 사람이네!","variant_male_record_index":"130713","variant_female_record_index":"130714","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210908013:1":{"text":"나라, 그럼 이제부터 충동적인 행동은 안 하는 거야, 알겠지?","source_cn":"奈拉，我们约定好了，不能冲动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7E1BD24DCA91CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210908014:1":{"text":"손가락 걸고 약속해! ","source_cn":"拉钩钩，约定不会变！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1235979BF4DAF90F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210908015:1":{"text":"자자, 어린이 교육은 그쯤하고, 어서 떠나자고.","source_cn":"好了好了，对小孩的教育就到此为止，我们赶紧离开吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EEBA51F98596247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210908016:1":{"text":"함정이 있는 곳이니까, 지금 당장은 괜찮더라도 조심해서 나쁠 건 없어.","source_cn":"毕竟这里是陷阱区，虽然一时半会还没遇到危险，但是小心点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BE02970270201B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210908017:1":{"text":"언니, 손잡아줄 수 있어?","source_cn":"姐姐，可以抓住我的手吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x323390E97EF66096","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210908018:1":{"text":"... 그래, 가자.","source_cn":"……嗯。走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897B0971C5D3248D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"그래, 나라의 잘못이 아니야","source_cn":"嗯，不是奈拉的错","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB86DF98BDB4B582","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래, 나라의 잘못이 아니야","female":"그래, 나라의 잘못이 아니야","variant_male_record_index":"65768","variant_female_record_index":"65769","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210908012:1":{"text":"알았어... 다음엔 말 잘 들을게...","source_cn":"知道了……下次我会听话的……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF93ABB85CCA39A41","variant_status":"runtime_g